# Doraemon data directory (config with secrets, sessions, screenshots, logs).
# The knowledge/ subdirectory is EXCEPTION: it is team-shared and committable
# (corrections / success_paths / kb). Ignore contents, then re-include knowledge.
.enikk-home/*
!.enikk-home/knowledge/

# Skills are team-shared too (SKILL.md files guided real sessions — see
# 2026-09-07 ioa session). Only WORK skills are shared; upstream game samples
# (nikke, wuthering-waves) and anything else stays local.
!.enikk-home/skills/
.enikk-home/skills/*
!.enikk-home/skills/ioa/
!.enikk-home/skills/ioa-actions/
!.enikk-home/skills/web-actions/
!.enikk-home/skills/wecom/

